  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MICRO-FUND FOR REFUGEE ASSISTANCE - PROJECTS COUNSELLING SERVICE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To support actions designed to create and/or strengthen organisations representing refugees and internally displaced people and the local NGOs supporting them.

2) To provide financial assistance for projects which enable refugees and displaced people to participate in productive activities to generate income to meet basic needs and facilitate their social integration and development.

3) To promote the organisation of refugees and displaced people through education and training.

4) To recognise the specific needs of refugee and displaced women through the promotion and implementation of projects with a gender perspective

5) to coordinate actions with other agencies concerning the protection of the target population and engage in advocacy initiatives on their behalf.

6) To monitor the situation of refugees, internally displaced persons and returnees and to provide updated and regular information to those concerned.

7) To promote civic rights and legal training and education with an emphasis on building local democracy.</narrative>
  </description>
